    1331   00:46EE  B7                      or  a
    1332   00:46EF                      WIFI_CONNECT_AP_SRCH.1:
    1333   00:46EF  CA FD 46                jp  z,WIFI_CONNECT_AP_PWDQ
    1334   00:46F2  7E                      ld  a,(hl)
    1335   00:46F3  23                      inc hl
    1336   00:46F4  B7                      or  a
