    2095   00:4BD1                      WAIT_MENU_SCMD_RESPONSE_ST1.1:
    2096   00:4BD1                          ; nz, check the data
    2097   00:4BD1                          RECEIVE_DATA
    2097   00:4BD1  DB 06             >     in a,(IN_DATA_PORT)
    2098   00:4BD3  BA                      cp  d                           ; Is response of our command?
