    3510   00:5231  DB 06             >     in a,(IN_DATA_PORT)
    3511   00:5233  FE 0A                   cp  10                          ; Is response of our command?
    3512   00:5235  20 EF                   jr  nz,TCPIP_UDP_STATE_ST1
