    4215   00:555A  DB 06             >     in a,(IN_DATA_PORT)
    4216   00:555C  FE 0E                   cp  14                          ; Is response of our command?
    4217   00:555E  20 EF                   jr  nz,TCPIP_TCP_CLOSE_ST1
