    5584   00:5BC8  DB 06             >     in a,(IN_DATA_PORT)
    5585   00:5BCA  FE 11                   cp  17                          ; Is response of our command?
    5586   00:5BCC  20 EF                   jr  nz,TCPIP_TCP_SEND_ST1
    5587   00:5BCE                          ; now get return code, if return code other than 0, it is finished
    5588   00:5BCE                      TCPIP_TCP_SEND_RC:
    5589   00:5BCE                          CHECK_DATA
    5589   00:5BCE  DB 07             >     in  a,(IN_STS_PORT)
